<title>JAPAN: Shinobu Foods - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shinobu Foods - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 15.69		vs	   19.74</p>
<p> Operating	  111 million	 vs	  111 million</p>
<p> Current	loss 71 million	 v     prft 22 million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 72 million	 vs    prft 10 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 3.91 yen	  vs     prft 0.54 yen</p>
<p> Shares		19 million	 vs	   19 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shinobu Foods Products Co Ltd is a specialist maker of cooked rice products.</p>
</text>
